<title>USA: Fed One Bancorp Inc Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Fed One Bancorp Inc Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>WHEELING, W.Va. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997     1996</p>
<p> TOTAL INTEREST INCOME		 6,190    6,099</p>
<p> PROVISION FOR LOAN LOSSES		30	 20</p>
<p> NET INCOME				  821	803</p>
<p>PRIMARY/FULLY DILUTED</p>
<p>    EARNINGS PER SHARE		  0.33     0.30</p>
<p>AVERAGE NUMBER OF SHARES OUTSTANDING:</p>
<p>     PRIMARY					  2,457,960</p>
<p>     FULLY DILUTED				  2,462,474</p>
<p>	    (In Thousands  Except  per Share Data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Avg shrs exclude ESOP shares not committed to be released, and include common stock equivalents.</p>
<p>Company repurchased 19,100 shares in 1997 Q1.</p>
</text>
